#: includes/class-wwpp-settings.php:691
msgid "Wholesale Role/Shipping Method Mapping"
msgstr "Correspondance Rôle grossiste/Mode d’expédition"

#: includes/class-wwpp-settings.php:693
msgid ""
"Map the shipping methods you wish to restrict wholesale customers to use within a shipping zone.<br/><br/>\n"
"                                     <b>1.</b> Select the wholesale role you wish to restrict<br/>\n"
"                                     <b>2.</b> Choose the shipping zone you want this to apply to<br/>\n"
"                                     <b>3.</b> Finally, choose the shipping method in that shipping zone that you wish to restrict the selected wholesale role to.<br/><br/>\n"
"                                     You can repeat this process to map multiple shipping methods per zone & multiple zones per role.\n"
"                                     <h2>Non-Zoned Shipping Methods</h2>\n"
"                                     <p>Non-Zoned shipping methods covers third party shipping methods extensions that register their shipping methods globally meaning they appear to the user always and do not take the shipping zone into account at all.<br/><br/></p>\n"
"                                     <p>To map these non-zoned methods, please select the <b>\"Use Non-Zoned Shipping Methods\"</b> checkbox and select the method from the list.</p>"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-wwpp-settings.php:738
msgid "This is where you set <b>\"general discount\"</b> for each wholesale role that will be applied to those users<br/>if a product they wish to purchase has no wholesale price set and no wholesale discount set at the product category level."
msgstr "Ici vous pouvez définir la <b>\"réduction générique\"</b> pour chaque rôle grossiste qui sera appliquée à ces utilisateurs<br/>si le produit qu’ils souhaitent acheter n’a pas de prix de gros défini et qu’aucune réduction de gros n’a été définie au niveau de la catégorie du produit."

#: includes/class-wwpp-settings.php:790
msgid ""
"Optionally give an additional discount for specific wholesale roles based on the cart subtotal price (excluding taxes & shipping). Discounts are shown in the totals table and are applied to the entire order.<br/><br/>\n"
"                                Simply select a wholesale user role, the subtotal price at which the additional discount should start to apply to their order, and the discount amount to give either as a fixed amount or a percentage of the cart subtotal.<br/><br/>\n"
"                                You can tier additional discounts by adding extra subtotal price breakpoints. Only one discount will apply."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-wwpp-settings.php:923
msgid "Clear all variable product price range and wholesale price cache"
msgstr "Supprimer le cache de toutes les fourchettes de prix de produits variables et de prix de gros"

#: includes/class-wwpp-settings.php:925
